					<![CDATA[
						 <p>They basically attempt the very thing you have described through Project SCRAMBLE, with less-than-optimal results, as documented in <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/incident-096-1-a">Incident 096-1-A</a>.</p> <p>The effects only trigger if you see its face, so if you just approach from behind and put a bag over its head while it's docile, containment can be restored.</p> 
				 	]]>
